# Usage

This Java project is ready for Continuous Integration (CI).

The default `app.image` mode is `libs`.

## Run modes

### libs

```console
mvn -Dapp.image=libs clean package
java -cp "target/${artifactId}-${version}.jar:target/libs/*" ${package}.App
```

### jlink and native

`jlink` and `native` image modes are pending parent POM alignment and are not part of the initial supported Docker target.

## Docker

Build the initial `finalLibs` image:

```console
docker build --target finalLibs \
  --build-arg APP_MAIN_CLASS=${package}.App \
  -t ${artifactId}:libs \
  -f docker/Dockerfile .
```

Using Docker Compose:

```console
IMAGE_NAME=${artifactId} APP_MAIN_CLASS=${package}.App docker compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml build
```
